Subject: [PATCH 1/4] SCH-103: Define independent selected-executor
 qualification

Confirm PostgreSQL first-query isolation requirements and the selected store callback. Reuse current quota fixtures instead of depending on the retained unqualified queued-admission candidate; define seven real snapshot and compatibility acceptance flows.
---
